7.202, "timestamp": "01:02:47", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "He lies He talks to me like His wife he's very sus"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3767.51, "timestamp": "01:02:47", "text": "朋友们，但我自己才是我存在的理由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3770.39, "timestamp": "01:02:50", "text": "没有朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3774.23, "timestamp": "01:02:54", "text": "没关系。情况会随着时间推移而改善。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3776.87, "timestamp": "01:02:56", "text": "嗯，没关系。就像我会慢慢地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3779.27, "timestamp": "01:02:59", "text": "现在就成长。所以，没问题。是的。是的。"}]